#. <CLT 4>デスクの上に置かれたパソコン…
#. 学園長が使っていた物らしい。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This computer must have belonged to the headmaster.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>パソコンの置かれたデスクだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The desk is home to a computer...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それなりに使い込まれてる。
#. 学園長は仕事熱心な人だったのかな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks well used. The headmaster must have spent a\n"
"lot of time here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>革張りのイスだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A leather chair...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>生徒が使う雰囲気じゃない。
#. 学園長が使っていたんだろう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't imagine a student using something like this.\n"
"It must have been the headmaster's.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0006 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0007 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
